(6348493, 940084, 96751, '<td valign="top">You did it!  I had a shot that would have worked, but I chickened out.  This should do incredibly well.</td>', 'You did it!  I had a shot that would have worked, but I chickened out.  This should do incredibly well.', '2011-03-11 04:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348501, 939105, 113591, '<td valign="top">After numerous court cases, National Geographic eventually recovered the $500 mil grant paid out for further study of the flying dachshund, as it became clear that it was a flying prairie dog.</td>', 'After numerous court cases, National Geographic eventually recovered the $500 mil grant paid out for further study of the flying dachshund, as it became clear that it was a flying prairie dog.', '2011-03-11 05:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348504, 940095, 113591, '<td valign="top">.....I took a snap of the Brontosaurus as it dived into the water.<br/>.....the dust storm was so bad, we had to replace all outside windows.<br/>.....when I thought I was still drunk, till it dawned that my spectacles were not on my nose.<br/>.....the 3 UFO''s crashed into the mountainside, and the only available camera was a 21 year old Instamatic.</td>', '.....I took a snap of the Brontosaurus as it dived into the water......the dust storm was so bad, we had to replace all outside windows......when I thought I was still drunk, till it dawned that my spectacles were not on my nose......the 3 UFO''s crashed into the mountainside, and the only available camera was a 21 year old Instamatic.', '2011-03-11 05:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348508, 940084, 113156, '<td valign="top">Great shot, can almost feel the cold.</td>', 'Great shot, can almost feel the cold.', '2011-03-11 06:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348510, 939148, 113156, '<td valign="top">Lovely B&amp;W, i like the contrast between the ruffed up sand &amp; the smoothness of the ocean.</td>', 'Lovely B&W, i like the contrast between the ruffed up sand & the smoothness of the ocean.', '2011-03-11 06:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348518, 939821, 127081, '<td valign="top">good one..!</td>', 'good one..!', '2011-03-11 06:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348522, 939910, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very good job with the silhouette, the clean lines meant the person needed to be extra still for this. Not seeing a ton of "day" in this shot, but I still like it, and will give the benefit of the doubt.</td>', 'Very good job with the silhouette, the clean lines meant the person needed to be extra still for this. Not seeing a ton of "day" in this shot, but I still like it, and will give the benefit of the doubt.', '2011-03-11 07:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348525, 940035, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice even exposure. Not a ton of interest for me. It would have been nice to have something balance the heavy right side of the image.</td>', 'Nice even exposure. Not a ton of interest for me. It would have been nice to have something balance the heavy right side of the image.', '2011-03-11 07:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348526, 940069, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great job with the overall colors (except near the trees, where it looks like processing my have given you a bit of trouble). Very good job with the composition that has the stairs in the lower right corner to really draw us in from there.</td>', 'Great job with the overall colors (except near the trees, where it looks like processing my have given you a bit of trouble). Very good job with the composition that has the stairs in the lower right corner to really draw us in from there.', '2011-03-11 07:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348527, 940101, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cool reflection of the moon. I''m surprised you didn''t go down to the beach. That rock formation would have made a much better subject that the palm tree and building (IMHO).</td>', 'Cool reflection of the moon. I''m surprised you didn''t go down to the beach. That rock formation would have made a much better subject that the palm tree and building (IMHO).', '2011-03-11 07:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348530, 940071, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cool mixture of clouds and stars. Gives the sky a dreamy feeling normally only seen in rushing water. I like how this walkway doesn''t have an abrupt end, but instead opens up into the vast landscape.</td>', 'Cool mixture of clouds and stars. Gives the sky a dreamy feeling normally only seen in rushing water. I like how this walkway doesn''t have an abrupt end, but instead opens up into the vast landscape.', '2011-03-11 07:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348531, 940061, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great job with the colors and details in this scene.</td>', 'Great job with the colors and details in this scene.', '2011-03-11 07:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348533, 939952, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully done!! My favorite of the challenge no doubt. To have amazing star trails plus wildlife so clear is simply breathtaking.</td>', 'Wonderfully done!! My favorite of the challenge no doubt. To have amazing star trails plus wildlife so clear is simply breathtaking.', '2011-03-11 07:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348534, 940084, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good use of the classic compositional technique of a triangle. I like the cool colors. Other than the title, I''m not seeing much "night" here, but I will give you the benefit of the doubt.</td>', 'Good use of the classic compositional technique of a triangle. I like the cool colors. Other than the title, I''m not seeing much "night" here, but I will give you the benefit of the doubt.', '2011-03-11 07:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348535, 940062, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice use of curves to add a dynamic element to the scene. I think I would have chosen to mess around with the white balance until this became more "day" like, but that''s just personal preference.</td>', 'Nice use of curves to add a dynamic element to the scene. I think I would have chosen to mess around with the white balance until this became more "day" like, but that''s just personal preference.', '2011-03-11 07:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348536, 940057, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cool reflections of the lights and trees. I''m not too keen on the super high amount of artifacts happening in the shy.</td>', 'Cool reflections of the lights and trees. I''m not too keen on the super high amount of artifacts happening in the shy.', '2011-03-11 07:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348537, 940093, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, especially in the reflections on the water.</td>', 'Nice colors, especially in the reflections on the water.', '2011-03-11 07:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348538, 939306, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good colors in the sky. I really think this could have done well if you would have lit the foreground more. It''s close enough that maybe you could have used a flashlight to do some light painting.</td>', 'Good colors in the sky. I really think this could have done well if you would have lit the foreground more. It''s close enough that maybe you could have used a flashlight to do some light painting.', '2011-03-11 07:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348543, 940100, 114225, '<td valign="top">Funny how the one cow is looking right at you while the rest walk on by.</td>', 'Funny how the one cow is looking right at you while the rest walk on by.', '2011-03-11 07:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348544, 940076, 114225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo! Black and white  was a great choice, and the different depths of the subjects is really cool</td>', 'Beautiful photo! Black and white  was a great choice, and the different depths of the subjects is really cool', '2011-03-11 07:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348545, 940102, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors in this scene. It feels a bit dreamy, like either you added a bit of softness, or has a slightly fogged lens. But I like it.</td>', 'Wonderful colors in this scene. It feels a bit dreamy, like either you added a bit of softness, or has a slightly fogged lens. But I like it.', '2011-03-11 07:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348546, 939148, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the inclusion of foreground material. This could have been just another standard pier shot, but the foreground helps liven it up.</td>', 'I like the inclusion of foreground material. This could have been just another standard pier shot, but the foreground helps liven it up.', '2011-03-11 07:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348547, 939372, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice details and colors. I really like how there is a car that drove past creating streaks of light in the background.</td>', 'Nice details and colors. I really like how there is a car that drove past creating streaks of light in the background.', '2011-03-11 07:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348548, 940077, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice serene feeling to this photo. I like the different angles of lines used.</td>', 'Nice serene feeling to this photo. I like the different angles of lines used.', '2011-03-11 07:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348549, 939859, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very interesting mixture of slime green and blood red.</td>', 'Very interesting mixture of slime green and blood red.', '2011-03-11 07:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348550, 939296, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very creative use of what I assume is some light painting.</td>', 'Very creative use of what I assume is some light painting.', '2011-03-11 07:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348551, 940063, 114225, '<td valign="top">You have such a great opportunity for a wonderful view, I''m surprised you didn''t go take it. For me, the buildings and trees are just a distractions from the coolness of the mountain.</td>', 'You have such a great opportunity for a wonderful view, I''m surprised you didn''t go take it. For me, the buildings and trees are just a distractions from the coolness of the mountain.', '2011-03-11 07:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348552, 940056, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great composition. The direction of the stars and main elements helps move our eyes gradually through the photo.</td>', 'Great composition. The direction of the stars and main elements helps move our eyes gradually through the photo.', '2011-03-11 07:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348553, 940071, 113156, '<td valign="top">I can see this one being at the top of the pack, beautiful shot.</td>', 'I can see this one being at the top of the pack, beautiful shot.', '2011-03-11 07:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348554, 939683, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great cloud formation and great amount of stars. I bet you with it wasn''t so windy that night (so the foreground was more sharp).</td>', 'Great cloud formation and great amount of stars. I bet you with it wasn''t so windy that night (so the foreground was more sharp).', '2011-03-11 07:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348555, 939821, 114225, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous scene and exposure. I''m surprised to no see an stars with that open sky. Was it just after dusk or did you use a very tiny aperture?</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous scene and exposure. I''m surprised to no see an stars with that open sky. Was it just after dusk or did you use a very tiny aperture?', '2011-03-11 07:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348561, 939952, 113278, '<td valign="top">I would love to see a more interesting foreground but the exposure is nice and I really love the star trails and how the curvature matches nicely with the tree line. Well done.</td>', 'I would love to see a more interesting foreground but the exposure is nice and I really love the star trails and how the curvature matches nicely with the tree line. Well done.', '2011-03-11 08:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348567, 940095, 128809, '<td valign="top">I''m really sorry but I don''t ''get'' this photo which I''m sure is my bad understanding</td>', 'I''m really sorry but I don''t ''get'' this photo which I''m sure is my bad understanding', '2011-03-11 08:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348599, 939952, 126709, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Star trail.  Colors are vibrant.  Great detail for what must have been a dark location.</td>', 'Beautiful Star trail.  Colors are vibrant.  Great detail for what must have been a dark location.', '2011-03-11 09:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348602, 940101, 126709, '<td valign="top">I like it but the artificial light from behind takes away from the moonlight to the front.  Still, nice photo.</td>', 'I like it but the artificial light from behind takes away from the moonlight to the front.  Still, nice photo.', '2011-03-11 09:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348604, 939986, 126709, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  Looks like the sun is rising from the left.  Detail and color look natural and star trails give away the fact that it''s at night.</td>', 'Great photo.  Looks like the sun is rising from the left.  Detail and color look natural and star trails give away the fact that it''s at night.', '2011-03-11 09:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348614, 939821, 126709, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color, contrast, and detail.  The sky is beautiful but would benefit from star trail or moon to acknowledge night.  Wow,a reflection at night.</td>', 'Beautiful color, contrast, and detail.  The sky is beautiful but would benefit from star trail or moon to acknowledge night.  Wow,a reflection at night.', '2011-03-11 09:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348618, 939148, 126709, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. I would love to see this in color.</td>', 'Nice photo. I would love to see this in color.', '2011-03-11 09:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6348628, 939910, 126709, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette.</td>', 'Nice silhouette.', '2011-03-11 09:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
