(6348783, 940095, 124346, '<td valign="top">Hello, I''ve seen a lot of this kind of pictures among different challenges, but I don''t really understand them in a photographic point of view.  I''ve learn that the picture should transmit a sensation, a feeling, using composition, colors, etc, but this type of pictures break that standard.  Could you explain to me a little bit this picture?  I want to learn always.  Thanks.</td>', 'Hello, I''ve seen a lot of this kind of pictures among different challenges, but I don''t really understand them in a photographic point of view.  I''ve learn that the picture should transmit a sensation, a feeling, using composition, colors, etc, but this type of pictures break that standard.  Could you explain to me a little bit this picture?  I want to learn always.  Thanks.', '2011-03-11 14:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
