(6352094, 939921, 108069, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo. Great detail, super perspective. I''d wager with a few tweaks you might be able to retire on this one. It''s that close to ultimate awesomeness. Nice work.</td>', 'Lovely photo. Great detail, super perspective. I''d wager with a few tweaks you might be able to retire on this one. It''s that close to ultimate awesomeness. Nice work.', '2011-03-15 19:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6352102, 940092, 108069, '<td valign="top">Yeah, well, marred. I like it, but it''s blatant in your face design and color and for that it''s great but it doesn''t fit the theme, as nothing seems to be at day. I like it, but no. And honestly, a creative crop would have really helped.</td>', 'Yeah, well, marred. I like it, but it''s blatant in your face design and color and for that it''s great but it doesn''t fit the theme, as nothing seems to be at day. I like it, but no. And honestly, a creative crop would have really helped.', '2011-03-15 20:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6352107, 939910, 108069, '<td valign="top">Quite beautiful. Nice scene, super sharp, certainly portrays daylight scene while showing the real time. Lonely silhouette is always powerful and this nicely done. Excellent.</td>', 'Quite beautiful. Nice scene, super sharp, certainly portrays daylight scene while showing the real time. Lonely silhouette is always powerful and this nicely done. Excellent.', '2011-03-15 20:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6352143, 939296, 108069, '<td valign="top">It''s a beautiful photo. Outstanding composition and wonderful colors. Doesn''t at all say daylight to me but I don''t much care either.</td>', 'It''s a beautiful photo. Outstanding composition and wonderful colors. Doesn''t at all say daylight to me but I don''t much care either.', '2011-03-15 20:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6352160, 940063, 108069, '<td valign="top">The white of the snow-capped hills is quite nice. Nice contrast against the blue of <strike>night</strike> DAY! A bit of a confusing scene with all the lines and distractions, but my eye is still drawn to the snow and the runs, and that''s nice. Nicely exposed. I do just want to get up there though. It''s really all I can think about. I guess you''ve moved me then.</td>', 'The white of the snow-capped hills is quite nice. Nice contrast against the blue of night DAY! A bit of a confusing scene with all the lines and distractions, but my eye is still drawn to the snow and the runs, and that''s nice. Nicely exposed. I do just want to get up there though. It''s really all I can think about. I guess you''ve moved me then.', '2011-03-15 20:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6352161, 940069, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective. Like daylight fading away into night. It seems a little worked over, like HDR or something, but I do like the perspective and light.</td>', 'Nice perspective. Like daylight fading away into night. It seems a little worked over, like HDR or something, but I do like the perspective and light.', '2011-03-15 20:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6352169, 939854, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nice lines with a subliminal curve back to the hills and sky. Sharp, nice tonal range. Well done.</td>', 'Nice lines with a subliminal curve back to the hills and sky. Sharp, nice tonal range. Well done.', '2011-03-15 20:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
