(6352241, 940077, 108069, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. The greatest pull of this image is the shadows, and if cropped differently it''d be stunning. As it is it''s only partly stunning. Very nice. I''d like to revisit this with a different crop.</td>', 'Beautiful. The greatest pull of this image is the shadows, and if cropped differently it''d be stunning. As it is it''s only partly stunning. Very nice. I''d like to revisit this with a different crop.', '2011-03-15 21:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
