(6352254, 939170, 108069, '<td valign="top">Well done on exposure length. Very cool how you''ve got the lights and then stars as well.</td>', 'Well done on exposure length. Very cool how you''ve got the lights and then stars as well.', '2011-03-15 22:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6352260, 940062, 108069, '<td valign="top">I do love the tones and colors. A white balance adjustment might have gotten you more points, but I do not care. Lovely scene.</td>', 'I do love the tones and colors. A white balance adjustment might have gotten you more points, but I do not care. Lovely scene.', '2011-03-15 22:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6352281, 939306, 108069, '<td valign="top">Well it''s an amazing shot, no question. Nice exposure to get what you have, but... it is a night shot. You know that. It''s awesome, and if you let me take a look at this I have a sick crop in mind.  Bottom line, it''s a wonderful photo, but it probably won''t do as well as it should because nothing looks like day.</td>', 'Well it''s an amazing shot, no question. Nice exposure to get what you have, but... it is a night shot. You know that. It''s awesome, and if you let me take a look at this I have a sick crop in mind.  Bottom line, it''s a wonderful photo, but it probably won''t do as well as it should because nothing looks like day.', '2011-03-15 22:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6352290, 939668, 108069, '<td valign="top">There''s a nice story here. And nice colors. Well done.</td>', 'There''s a nice story here. And nice colors. Well done.', '2011-03-15 22:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6352293, 940076, 108069, '<td valign="top">Well composition rarely gets better. Nor do tones. Beautiful.</td>', 'Well composition rarely gets better. Nor do tones. Beautiful.', '2011-03-15 22:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6352309, 939944, 108069, '<td valign="top">Just beautiful. I look at this and I want to stretch it, and then I see the bridge does as well. But of course it is what it is. It''s fantastic.</td>', 'Just beautiful. I look at this and I want to stretch it, and then I see the bridge does as well. But of course it is what it is. It''s fantastic.', '2011-03-15 22:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6352313, 940082, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great image. Reminds me of a shot I once took and blew, but this is nice. Look at the foreground, let your eyes travel northwest. Wonderful depth. Lovely.</td>', 'Great image. Reminds me of a shot I once took and blew, but this is nice. Look at the foreground, let your eyes travel northwest. Wonderful depth. Lovely.', '2011-03-15 22:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6352314, 939148, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great texture and detail in the sand. Very strong foreground. Excellent close/middle/far layers. Awesome tones. Just all around great photo.</td>', 'Great texture and detail in the sand. Very strong foreground. Excellent close/middle/far layers. Awesome tones. Just all around great photo.', '2011-03-15 22:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6352317, 940084, 108069, '<td valign="top">This is just beautiful. Amazing tones and range. Excellent composition. Nice of the birds to hold still. Fantastic shot.</td>', 'This is just beautiful. Amazing tones and range. Excellent composition. Nice of the birds to hold still. Fantastic shot.', '2011-03-15 22:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6352318, 939952, 108069, '<td valign="top">Fairly incredible. Something about it makes me want to shake it left, but then we''d have even more star trails. Fantastic capture. Exposure is true to day, yet those stars... awesome. And a herd of deer? Elk? Wow. An unexpected benefit of this theme. Excellent.</td>', 'Fairly incredible. Something about it makes me want to shake it left, but then we''d have even more star trails. Fantastic capture. Exposure is true to day, yet those stars... awesome. And a herd of deer? Elk? Wow. An unexpected benefit of this theme. Excellent.', '2011-03-15 22:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6352319, 940071, 108069, '<td valign="top">Fantastic job. Wonderful photo. The shadow really takes it up a notch in the daylight perception aspect. Excellent lines, great detail. Stars tell the time. Very well done.</td>', 'Fantastic job. Wonderful photo. The shadow really takes it up a notch in the daylight perception aspect. Excellent lines, great detail. Stars tell the time. Very well done.', '2011-03-15 22:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6352320, 939266, 108069, '<td valign="top">Well this is one of the best examples of professional management of exposure. Probably the best. Sharp, noiseless, detail, texture, trees vs. a starry sky. How?! Superb.</td>', 'Well this is one of the best examples of professional management of exposure. Probably the best. Sharp, noiseless, detail, texture, trees vs. a starry sky. How?! Superb.', '2011-03-15 22:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6352321, 940057, 108069, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition. Reflection of the town is amazing. Tendrils. Freakin'' awesome stuff. One of my top picks.</td>', 'Wonderful composition. Reflection of the town is amazing. Tendrils. Freakin'' awesome stuff. One of my top picks.', '2011-03-15 22:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6352834, 939157, 108069, '<td valign="top">The motion of this is different to anything here. Those star trails feel like hail across the head. It''s probably the most powerful photo in the bunch. There''s a sense of uneasiness yet stability to it. And then layers on top. Well done.<br/> <br/>I don''t care what you think and no matter what you have to say I will not change my score on this image. I gave it an 8, and an 8 it will remain.</td>', 'The motion of this is different to anything here. Those star trails feel like hail across the head. It''s probably the most powerful photo in the bunch. There''s a sense of uneasiness yet stability to it. And then layers on top. Well done. I don''t care what you think and no matter what you have to say I will not change my score on this image. I gave it an 8, and an 8 it will remain.', '2011-03-16 05:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
