(6355974, 939952, 112739, '<td valign="top">Very well done Richard. Can''t for the life of me figure out how you could get anything less than a 6 on this. I think it''s due to maybe voters think this technique is supposed to be easy or something. Anyway, congrats on an outstanding image, I knew this was yours the second I saw it! Outstanding effort with going out in the middle of the night to do this.</td>', 'Very well done Richard. Can''t for the life of me figure out how you could get anything less than a 6 on this. I think it''s due to maybe voters think this technique is supposed to be easy or something. Anyway, congrats on an outstanding image, I knew this was yours the second I saw it! Outstanding effort with going out in the middle of the night to do this.', '2011-03-18 11:35:49.000000', NULL, 0),
