(6356933, 939633, 69008, '<td valign="top">Well done!  I have a few of the shuttle fly-overs in my collection, but nothing like this with both the station and the shuttle distinctly visible. I like the fisheye, and I wonder about the stars on the ground lights at f 5.6. Usually that is a result of smaller aperture like f11 or 16.</td>', 'Well done!  I have a few of the shuttle fly-overs in my collection, but nothing like this with both the station and the shuttle distinctly visible. I like the fisheye, and I wonder about the stars on the ground lights at f 5.6. Usually that is a result of smaller aperture like f11 or 16.', '2011-03-19 13:22:54.000000', NULL, 0),
